  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adaptation Funds, support to FIRCA Cote d&apos;Ivoire</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Inter-professional Funds for agricultural research and extension (FIRCA) is recently nominated as National Implementing Entity (NIE) by the Adaptation Funds. The FIRCA ask us to support the development of the proposal for FIRCA as they have lack of capacity on proposal writing and mainstreaming green growth. Cote d&#x2019;Ivoire has a budget of 10 millions under Adaptation Funds, the USD 6 millions is already disbursed by international partner and the USD 4 millions is reserved for the FIRCA as the National entity. GGGI will serve as Executing Entity to support the implementation of the USD 4 millions project.</narrative>
  </description>
